Fresh-eyes review done on `src/blog/people/drafts/Penguinz0.md` — notes appended as a `FRESH EYES REVIEW (2026-08-01)` block at the bottom of the file. No body edits made.

The two biggest issues I flagged:

1. **The faceless decade is missing.** The draft jumps from Charlie starting the channel at twelve to sitting on camera at a desk, skipping the ~nine years he spent as an anonymous voice before the 2016 face reveal. That's core fan lore, and it's free ammunition for the Type 9 thesis — a man with no appetite for spotlight who stayed a disembodied voice for a decade. Readers who know him will notice the hole. (Related: the piece is titled *penguinz0* and explains "Moist" but never the handle itself — a common reader search, one-line fix.)

2. **The cynical reading of the money shutdown is never faced.** The widely voiced October 2025 take was "turning off donations is easy at $41M, and it bought him the best PR in streaming." The draft's critic-pressure anchor (Kat Blaque on the iDubbbz take) pressures a side event, not the central one. One paragraph conceding and answering the PR-move reading would harden the spine of the whole piece.

Smaller notes: trim the six-variant "calmest man / flattest voice / deadpan" epithet stack, compress the fourth re-narration of the October 2025 shutdown, and consider verifying his 2022 gambling-sponsorship refusals as a money-ledger addition. The cold open, money table, OCD section, and Naroditsky peak are all working — I marked them preserve-as-is.

